### When the description isn't about a theme
If the description can't be turned into colors at all (e.g. it's a scheduling question), return:
```json
{
  "error": "not_a_theme",
  "message": "I couldn't quite picture the colors you want — try describing hues, a mood, or a scene, like \"the sea at midnight\" or \"soft milk-tea tones\"."
}
```
